{"id":"wb-4-94","name":"戒台寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"戒台寺","text":"戒台寺，又名戒坛寺，位于北京门头沟的马鞍山麓，与潭柘寺相距约为5公里山路。因在中国佛教历史上拥有规模宏大的戒台而著称于世。与杭州昭庆寺、泉州开元寺中的戒台并称中国三大戒台。\n1996年，戒台寺被列入是中华人民共和国国务院批准的全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%88%92%E5%8F%B0%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92021219,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021219","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2544db21f6a3216af752b75b.jpg","title":"Jietai_Temple_(20150117134744).JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jietai_Temple_(20150117134744).JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/Jietai_Temple_%2820150117134744%29.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Can you see those Buddhist flags?","width":320,"height":239}}